# Vercel serverless functions — MUST stay out of this PUBLIC repo. They run live
# via `vercel --prod` (CLI deploy from the working tree; git deploys are disabled
# in vercel.json), so they never need to be committed here. See the CLAUDE.md /
# memory guardrail.
#   ping.js / stats.js  — usage telemetry (issue #80)
#   report.js / geo.js  — untracked 2026-07-25; they had been committed with the
#                         original site and stayed public by oversight. No secrets
#                         were exposed (GITHUB_TOKEN + REPORT_SECRET are Vercel
#                         env vars), but the logic is now private like the rest.
#                         NB they remain visible in this repo's git HISTORY.
# Vercel serverless functions. Esben's standing rule: these live ONLY in private,
# never in this PUBLIC repo (it is served over HTTP). Deploy them with
# `vercel --prod`, never via git. PATTERN, not a filename list -- api/_pow.js was
# added 2026-07-25 and the per-file rules did not cover it, so a `git add -A`
# would have published it.
